{"id": "en_wildfire_road_p1", "total": 65.13, "segments": [{"text": "If a raging wildfire blocks your escape road at dusk, do not hide inside a wooden cabin.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.26}, {"text": "Dan sees dark smoke filling the pine forest with only 10 minutes before flames cut off escape.", "start": 5.08, "end": 9.16}, {"text": "Safety experts urge everyone to leave early when told to evacuate because waiting is the most dangerous choice.", "start": 10.1, "end": 14.76}, {"text": "Dan must act fast on foot before the fiery blaze engulfs the entire mountain road tonight.", "start": 15.52, "end": 19.34}, {"text": "One.", "start": 20.12, "end": 20.3}, {"text": "Never run inside a small wooden cabin because dry logs burn extremely fast during wildfire conditions.", "start": 20.92, "end": 25.64}, {"text": "Two.", "start": 26.6, "end": 27.04}, {"text": "If you are stuck on foot, head immediately for ground with little fuel like a rocky area.", "start": 27.04, "end": 31.16}, {"text": "You can also target an open dirt road or ground that has already burned completely clear.", "start": 31.66, "end": 35.58}, {"text": "Three.", "start": 36.06, "end": 36.5}, {"text": "Dan runs away from the growing fire directly toward bare rocky ground with no dry trees.", "start": 37.14, "end": 41.3}, {"text": "He gets down low to the hard ground and crouches quietly to avoid the severe heat.", "start": 41.78, "end": 45.3}, {"text": "A massive wave of intense fire sweeps across the dense woods, incinerating the wooden cabin.", "start": 45.9, "end": 49.9}, {"text": "Dan made every right move on foot to stay alive while the heavy forest burned around him.", "start": 50.8, "end": 54.36}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan.", "start": 54.88, "end": 55.78}, {"text": "There was just one problem.", "start": 56.48, "end": 57.28}, {"text": "Dan reaches his car on the dirt trail just as falling sparks trap the vehicle completely.", "start": 57.9, "end": 61.98}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.34], ["a", 0.34